<title>USA: Lescarden reorganization approved.</title>
<headline>Lescarden reorganization approved.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lescarden Inc said on Wednesday that the U.S. Bankruptcy Court approved the company's reorganization plan, concluding the company's bankruptcy proceedings.</p>
<p>Lescarden, a bio-tech firm, said it will issue common stock for all unsecured pre-petition debt.</p>
<p>Upon completion the company will have converted all of its pre-petition debt, amounting to more than $2 million, into equity, the company said.</p>
<p>Under the plan, common shareholders receive nothing, a spokesman said.</p>
</text>
